# 0.26.5, statics P4 (`volec fix --only statics --group FILE`): the statics
# of base, front, places, the tools, guide and cli into base::ctx::Ctx, made
# once per process by main. Left out: what code generation's tasks reach
# (`--prune crate` drops it: P5), the view-typed statics (base::SRC and the
# tools' seven), WGSL_ARENA (P6), front::stdalloc's two flags (read by the
# generated stdsrc.vl), front::cpp::eval's EV_TOKS, EV_N and EV_POS (the
# C import's, own.conflict beside its context).
param pcx
type Ctx<Comp>
init ctx_new()
owner main
use crate::base::ctx::Ctx
use crate::base::comp::Comp
owner-use crate::base::ctx::ctx_new
